### fpx-server REST API (VS Code "REST Client" / JetBrains HTTP client format)
@host = http://localhost:8080
@key = change-me

### Health
GET {{host}}/healthz

### Stats
GET {{host}}/v1/stats
X-API-Key: {{key}}

### Extract (image -> template, optional WSQ). image = base64 BMP/PGM/TIFF/WSQ
POST {{host}}/v1/extract
X-API-Key: {{key}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"image": "<base64 image>", "dpi": 500, "format": "ansi", "wsq": true}

### Enrol / replace a customer with two fingers (template preferred; "image" also accepted)
# position: 1 R-thumb, 2 R-index, 3 R-middle, 4 R-ring, 5 R-little, 6 L-thumb, 7 L-index, ...
PUT {{host}}/v1/subjects/customer-42
X-API-Key: {{key}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"fingers": [
  {"position": 2, "template": "<base64 ANSI-378 or ISO-19794-2>"},
  {"position": 7, "image": "<base64 BMP/WSQ>", "dpi": 500}
]}

### Add or replace one finger
PUT {{host}}/v1/subjects/customer-42/fingers/3
X-API-Key: {{key}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"template": "<base64>"}

### List a customer's enrolled fingers
GET {{host}}/v1/subjects/customer-42
X-API-Key: {{key}}

### Remove one finger
DELETE {{host}}/v1/subjects/customer-42/fingers/3
X-API-Key: {{key}}

### 1:N identification with two fingers (fused per customer)
POST {{host}}/v1/identify
X-API-Key: {{key}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"fingers": [
  {"position": 2, "template": "<base64>"},
  {"position": 7, "template": "<base64>"}
], "top_k": 5}

### 1:N with a single finger (stricter single-finger threshold applies)
POST {{host}}/v1/identify
X-API-Key: {{key}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"position": 2, "template": "<base64>", "top_k": 5}

### 1:1 verification against an enrolled id (one or more fingers)
POST {{host}}/v1/verify
X-API-Key: {{key}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"id": "customer-42", "fingers": [
  {"position": 2, "template": "<base64>"},
  {"position": 7, "template": "<base64>"}
]}

### 1:1 of two templates (nothing stored)
POST {{host}}/v1/match
X-API-Key: {{key}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"a": "<base64>", "b": "<base64>"}

### Delete
DELETE {{host}}/v1/subjects/customer-42
X-API-Key: {{key}}
